From c7d31c003e89c9474e43a31f4ae48bc3eae98f8b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 23:20:20 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Result page: agreed plan design and Maria as the home-page
 example

- Progressive result page in six steps, honeycomb Starting Position map with
  line icons, white pillar cards with plum frames, two ways to continue,
  membership options and a downloadable plan.
- Plan rules: two focus pillars, two recommended practices plus two more if
  there is time, journey months within the member's time.
- Copy no longer says "small change"; the section is now "Where your effort
  will count most".
- Maria's example answers now focus on nutrition and mind.
- One reference page per member (Maria, Marta, Hugo); generate.js writes one
  page per member.
- .gitignore: keep .env and out/ out of the repo.
- Rebuilt index.html and assessment.html.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WEFH7Gs4uZdjdsQpw3Ytof
